decision_conditions:
The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted
shall be those as expressly stated in the applicant&#x27;s revised submission unless otherwise
approved or agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;

&lt;p&gt;The refuse/recycling bins associated with the development shall be stored at all times, other than on
collection days, in the designated refuse storage area inside the proposed building, as shown on the
approved drawing.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Details for
the proposed disposal of any foul and surface water run off, including separate connections and any onsite
surface water storage details required will be carried out in accordance with Approval of Details&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;PL/1939/25 dated&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;17-09-2025.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The works shall thereafter be retained.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
